{
  "$comment": "The spark-app template's feature manifest (docs/templates_dnx_terminal_PRD.md §4.2, D15). The pack step (MintPlayer.Spark.Templates.Build) generates from it the feature symbols in template.json, ide.host.json and dotnetcli.host.json, the host csproj's PackageReferences and the pinned-package list; nothing it generates is checked in. Program.cs, appsettings.json and the ClientApp stay hand-written, and MintPlayer.Spark.Templates.Tests checks them against this file. Every packable project under libs/ is in core, features or excluded (the coverage test); each feature's requires equals the features among its project's ProjectReferences (the graph test).",

  "core": [
    { "project": "spark/MintPlayer.Spark/MintPlayer.Spark.csproj" },
    { "project": "spark/MintPlayer.Spark.InMemory/MintPlayer.Spark.InMemory.csproj" },
    { "project": "spark/MintPlayer.Spark.RavenDB/MintPlayer.Spark.RavenDB.csproj" },
    { "project": "attributes/MintPlayer.Spark.Attributes/MintPlayer.Spark.Attributes.csproj" },
